--- TEE_CipherDoFinal
------------------------------------------------------------

--- The 'TEE_CipherDoFinal' function finalizes the cipher operation, processing data that has not been processed by previous calls to TEE_CipherUpdate as well as data supplied in 'srcData'.
--- See page 210 of the G.P. documentation for more details.

  msg cipherDoFinal : Oid List{Data} Oid -> Msg .
  msg finishTopCipherFinal : Oid List{Data} Oid -> Msg .
  msg finishCipherDoFinal : List{Data} Oid -> Msg .

  crl [cipher-do-final-subroutine] :
